{"title":"poisoned apple as seer, aquarius II","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/aquarius-ii","date":1770389040000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/11611218-653f-408e-811d-a589963bf418/aq_2.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1350\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/11611218-653f-408e-811d-a589963bf418/aq_2.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/11611218-653f-408e-811d-a589963bf418/aq_2.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/11611218-653f-408e-811d-a589963bf418/aq_2.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/11611218-653f-408e-811d-a589963bf418/aq_2.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/11611218-653f-408e-811d-a589963bf418/aq_2.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/11611218-653f-408e-811d-a589963bf418/aq_2.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/11611218-653f-408e-811d-a589963bf418/aq_2.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n  <p><em>this series is created for my collaboration with </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"><em>LJ of Ceremony</em></a><em> for their communal writing practice, </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Atmospheres</em></a><em>, based of the 36 decans of the astrological year. </em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>Aquarius II</strong> — February 1-10<br /><strong>Key themes from LJ</strong> — shapeshifting, divination, underworld<br /><strong>Before this: </strong><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/aquarius-i\" target=\"_blank\">exile of the black sheep, Aquarius I</a> <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/dosing-the-poison-cure-scorpio-ii\"><br /></a><br />*</p><p>this decan is about what happens after the <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/aquarius-i\" target=\"_blank\">black sheep</a> leaves for their exile — and what is possible on the other side of this death, (in this case, a death brought by a tiny bite of a poisoned apple). in every departure, there is always the possibility of rebirth and resurrection — even if this comes with immense grief. I am inspired by Aquarius II as the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Six_of_Swords\" target=\"_blank\">6 of Swords</a>, as the boat person rowing across the vast, watery, liminal space. </p><p>here, we embrace the in-between. we consume the enchanted fruit that can do transmutive things to us. when I think about the apple, I think of the biblical apple, of this poem <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/inside-the-apple-yehuda-amichai\">Inside the Apple by Yehuda Amichai</a>, which was one of my favorites when I was growing up. </p><p>this poisoned apple is a portal — in between worlds, between life and death. what we know, and what we will discover. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <h1>process</h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n